## 🆕 Using Claude Code Features (December 2025)

### Named Sessions
Name your sessions for easy resuming:
```bash
/rename feature-auth-implementation
# Later: claude --resume feature-auth-implementation
```

### Background Tasks
Run long tasks in background:
```bash
& npm test          # Run tests while you continue working
& npm run build     # Build in background
```

### LSP Integration
Claude can now navigate code like an IDE:
```
"Find all references to authenticateUser"
"Show me where UserConfig is defined"
```

### Model Selection
- Use **Opus 4.5** for complex architecture decisions
- Use **Sonnet 4.5** for regular development
- Switch models: Alt+P (Option+P on Mac)

